        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-counters-p16-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "眼: count actions",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "眼 after 看 can count a glance. The unit measures the act of looking, not the observer's eyes.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我看了一眼。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ kàn le yī yǎn 。",
                "meaning": "I took one glance.",
                "audio": "ebda29b3328887170a3a54762ba38230c74d3c34dc2edbf92f321046fee33c11"
              },
              {
                "text": "他又看了两眼。",
                "pinyin": "tā yòu kàn le liǎng yǎn 。",
                "meaning": "He took another two glances.",
                "audio": "c68f2dfe33b5f1e8131648ce4b99f953d9a684e9b6cac3fac427d7f01b8d6b24"
              }
            ]
          },
